			"Message": "fix(Project): Coordinate Cocoon and Mountain submodule updates for language provider registration\n\nSynchronize two Land submodules to fix language provider lookup failures:\n- **Cocoon**: Enhance VS Code shims with structural methods (Position.isBefore/isAfter, Range.contains/intersection), add language ID detection from file extensions, and support singular provider method names ($provideCompletion, $provideCodeAction, etc.)\n- **Mountain**: Align provider selector format to canonical [{ \"language\": ... }], always route SideCarIdentifier to \"cocoon-main\" for FeatureMethods, and add language inference fallback from file extension when document not open\n\nThis resolves the broken language feature IPC chain where Sky requests hover/completion → Mountain calls gRPC → Cocoon invokes provider but lookup was failing due to format mismatches and missing language detection.",
