			"Message": "feat(Project): Coordinate language provider registry and navigation services across Land submodules\n\nSynchronize four Land submodules with language intelligence and navigation features:\n\n- **Cocoon**: Add LanguageProviderRegistry singleton and $provide* method routing for 14 language feature methods (hover, completions, definition, references, code actions, document highlights, symbols, workspace symbols, formatting, signature help, rename, folding, inlay hints, code lenses)\n\n- **Mountain**: Add NavigationHistoryState for editor back/forward navigation stack and IPC handlers for history, label resolution, and text model registry\n\n- **Sky**: Remove obsolete Wind package aliases from Astro Vite config\n\n- **Wind**: Add four new Effect-TS services (HistoryService, LabelService, ModelService, TextModelResolverService) with Tauri IPC integration to Mountain backend\n\nThis completes the language intelligence IPC loop: Sky requests feature → Mountain calls gRPC → Cocoon invokes provider → result returns to Sky → Monaco displays.",
