			"Message": "chore(Project): Coordinate Land submodule updates with Wind service additions\n\nSynchronize nine Land submodules with build, style, and feature updates:\n- Wind: Add Decorations, Keybinding, Lifecycle, and WorkingCopy services - four new Effect-TS service layers with Tauri IPC integration for file decorations, keyboard shortcuts, startup phases, and dirty state tracking\n- Common: Reformat TypeScript declaration files for Workers API with consistent blank lines and indentation\n- Output: Reformat ESBuild configuration with consistent style and export Clean flag\n- Sky: Normalize Astro build artifact formatting - quotes, trailing newlines, type definitions\n- Rest: Standardize shell redirection spacing (>/dev/null to > /dev/null) and quote style\n- Worker: Reformat ESBuild configuration files for consistency across source and generated outputs\n- Cocoon: Format WorkspaceService and enhance TextDocument with getWordRangeAtPosition\n- Air: Remove unused versioning-strategy from dependabot.yml and normalize workflow whitespace\n- Mountain: Pointer update (no changes)\n\nThis coordinated update adds four new Wind services for editor UI management while standardizing formatting across the Land ecosystem.",
